WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.717 --> 00:00:10.506
with the skriblio desktop companion, your banana often comes to say hi, especially if you haven't journaled for a while.

2
00:00:10.556 --> 00:00:14.665
rest the pointer on the edge, and your journal slides out.

3
00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:18.045
or click the banana, then journal.

4
00:00:19.593 --> 00:00:23.643
type what's on your mind. the banana never reads it.

5
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:28.080
save, and it's on your phone too.

6
00:00:32.042 --> 00:00:34.552
your memory tree is here as well.

7
00:00:34.602 --> 00:00:37.852
drag the entries away, and zoom in.

8
00:00:39.382 --> 00:00:42.072
click a card to read that day again.

9
00:00:42.665 --> 00:00:46.075
for a longer entry, open it as a window.

10
00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:54.798
it comes with skriblio, and you can get it at skriblio.com/desktop.
